OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FDry with lots of strong
OL,6,Fsunshine, temperatures rising rapidly
OL,7,Fduring the morning. High level cloud
OL,8,Fwill make the skies a little hazy at
OL,9,Ftimes. Feeling widely hot, locally
OL,10,Fvery hot.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FHot
OL,13,For very hot with temperatures peaking
OL,14,Fon Thursday with plenty of strong
OL,15,Fsunshine. Turning a fresher and
OL,16,Fcloudier from Friday with the chance
OL,17,Fof an odd shower on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
